    "Include %@ 未展开,其中的主机不会出现在列表里": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Include %@ isn't expanded, so hosts inside it won't appear in this list"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Key 只存钥匙串(随 iCloud 钥匙串同步),本地模型(Ollama / LM Studio)可留空。地址只填域名时自动补 /v1,已带路径则按原样用。中转网关若提示不允许 /v1/messages,把接口格式切到「OpenAI 兼容」。开启自动执行后,危险命令与生产警戒主机仍会要求确认。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The key is stored only in the Keychain (synced via iCloud Keychain); leave it empty for local models (Ollama / LM Studio). A bare domain gets /v1 appended; a URL that already has a path is used as-is. If a relay says /v1/messages is not allowed, switch the API format to OpenAI-compatible. Even with auto-run on, dangerous commands and production hosts still require approval."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Key 只存钥匙串(随 iCloud 钥匙串同步)。默认直连 Anthropic API,可改为兼容的中转地址。开启自动执行后,危险命令与生产警戒主机仍会要求确认。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The key is stored only in the Keychain (synced via iCloud Keychain). Connects directly to the Anthropic API by default; a compatible proxy URL also works. Even with auto-run on, dangerous commands and production hosts still require approval."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keychain 中保存的凭据会一并删除,此操作不可撤销。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Credentials stored in Keychain will also be deleted. This cannot be undone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keychain 中的私钥会一并删除,此操作不可撤销。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
