    "模型": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Model"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "模型名": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Model name"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "模型或接口地址不存在,请在设置中检查模型名与 API 地址。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Model or endpoint not found. Check the model name and API URL in Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "模型需支持工具调用(function calling),否则 AI 无法在服务器上执行命令。Key 只存钥匙串(随 iCloud 钥匙串同步),本地模型(Ollama / LM Studio)可留空。地址只填域名时自动补 /v1,已带路径则按原样用。中转网关若提示不允许 /v1/messages,把接口格式切到「OpenAI 兼容」。开启自动执行后,危险命令与生产警戒主机仍会要求确认。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The model must support tool calling (function calling), otherwise the AI cannot run commands on the server. The key is stored only in the Keychain (synced via iCloud Keychain); leave it empty for local models (Ollama / LM Studio). A bare domain gets /v1 appended; a URL that already has a path is used as-is. If a relay says /v1/messages is not allowed, switch the API format to OpenAI-compatible. Even with auto-run on, dangerous commands and production hosts still require approval."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "模型需支持工具调用(function calling),否则 AI 无法在服务器上执行命令。Key 只存钥匙串(随 iCloud 钥匙串同步),本地模型(Ollama / LM Studio)可留空。地址末尾已是版本号(如 /v1、/api/paas/v4)就按原样用,否则自动补 /v1。中转网关若提示不允许 /v1/messages,把接口格式切到「OpenAI 兼容」。开启自动执行后,危险命令与生产警戒主机仍会要求确认。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The model must support tool calling (function calling), otherwise the AI cannot run commands on the server. The key is stored only in the Keychain (synced via iCloud Keychain); leave it empty for local models (Ollama / LM Studio). A URL already ending in a version segment (e.g. /v1, /api/paas/v4) is used as-is; otherwise /v1 is appended. If a relay says /v1/messages is not allowed, switch the API format to OpenAI-compatible. Even with auto-run on, dangerous commands and production hosts still require approval."
          }
        }
      }
    },
