    "适合禁止直接登录、只能 su 过去的账号:连上后自动执行 su - 用户,等到密码提示再从钥匙串填入,不会盲发;分屏新开的 shell 也会切换。密码只进钥匙串。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For accounts that cannot log in directly and are only reachable via su: after connecting, Berth runs su - user, waits for the password prompt, then fills the password from the Keychain (never sent blind). New shells opened by splits switch too. The password lives only in the Keychain."
